<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
  <title>Data-center capacity additions by country, 2022–2026</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f5f4ef;
      --surface: #fdfdfb;
      --ink: #182026;
      --muted: #667078;
      --quiet: #899198;
      --line: #d9ddd9;
      --line-strong: #bdc4c1;
      --control: #eef0ed;
      --focus: #0072b2;
      --shadow: 0 12px 34px rgb(28 35 39 / 8%);
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #101619;
        --surface: #171f23;
        --ink: #edf1f1;
        --muted: #a8b1b5;
        --quiet: #7f8a90;
        --line: #344047;
        --line-strong: #536169;
        --control: #222c31;
        --focus: #56b4e9;
        --shadow: 0 14px 36px rgb(0 0 0 / 24%);
      }
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--bg);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    button, select, input { font: inherit; }

    button, select { color: inherit; }

    button:focus-visible,
    select:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible,
    [tabindex="0"]:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--focus), transparent 45%);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .page {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 68px 0 42px;
    }

    .masthead {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 760px) 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.65rem);
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      line-height: 1.02;
    }

    .nowrap { white-space: nowrap; }

    .dek {
      max-width: 34rem;
      margin: 19px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .key {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .key div {
      padding-top: 11px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    }

    .key dt {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.09em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .key dd {
      margin: 4px 0 0;
      font-size: 0.91rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .chart-card {
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .controls {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px 28px;
      align-items: end;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    fieldset {
      min-width: 0;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
    }

    legend,
    .select-label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.69rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.075em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .segmented {
      display: inline-flex;
      gap: 2px;
      padding: 3px;
      background: var(--control);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .segmented label {
      position: relative;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .segmented input {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .segmented span {
      display: block;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .segmented input:checked + span {
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgb(20 28 32 / 12%);
    }

    select {
      min-height: 37px;
      padding: 6px 30px 6px 10px;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--control);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .reset {
      margin-left: auto;
      padding: 7px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: transparent;
      border: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .reset:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .reset[hidden] { display: none; }

    .chart-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: baseline;
      padding: 22px 24px 0;
    }

    .chart-meta strong {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .chart-meta span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .chart-scroll {
      overflow-x: auto;
      overscroll-behavior-inline: contain;
      scrollbar-color: var(--line-strong) transparent;
    }

    #chart {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 500px;
      shape-rendering: geometricPrecision;
    }

    .axis text {
      fill: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .axis .domain { display: none; }

    .axis line {
      stroke: var(--line);
      stroke-dasharray: 2 4;
    }

    .year-axis line { display: none; }

    .year-axis text {
      fill: var(--ink);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .country-line {
      fill: none;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
      stroke-width: 2.35;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .estimate-segment {
      stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
    }

    .data-point {
      stroke-width: 1.7;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .estimate-point {
      fill: var(--surface);
      stroke-width: 2.2;
    }

    .point-hit {
      cursor: pointer;
      fill: transparent;
      stroke: transparent;
      stroke-width: 1;
    }

    .point-hit:hover,
    .point-hit:focus-visible {
      fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface), transparent 35%);
      stroke: var(--ink);
      stroke-width: 1.5;
    }

    .axis-label {
      fill: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .estimate-boundary {
      stroke: var(--line-strong);
      stroke-dasharray: 3 4;
    }

    .direct-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      paint-order: stroke;
      stroke: var(--surface);
      stroke-linejoin: round;
      stroke-width: 4px;
    }

    .legend-wrap {
      padding: 18px 24px 22px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .legend-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: baseline;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .legend-head h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .legend-head p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
    }

    #legend {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 5px 10px;
    }

    .legend-item {
      display: flex;
      min-width: 0;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 5px 7px;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .legend-item:hover { background: var(--control); }

    .legend-item.not-shown {
      color: var(--quiet);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .legend-item.selected {
      background: var(--control);
      border-color: var(--line-strong);
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .swatch {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      width: 16px;
      height: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .country-name {
      overflow: hidden;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 550;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .tooltip {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 10;
      width: min(420px, calc(100vw - 24px));
      max-height: min(520px, calc(100vh - 24px));
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 15px 16px 16px;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface), transparent 2%);
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgb(0 0 0 / 20%);
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .tooltip[hidden] { display: none; }

    .tooltip-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: start;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .tooltip h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .tooltip-year {
      margin: 2px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }

    .tooltip-value {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      font-size: 1.18rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .tooltip-reasoning {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .tooltip a {
      color: var(--focus);
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .error {
      margin: 40px 24px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      color: #8e2b2b;
      background: #fff0ef;
      border: 1px solid #e7b7b3;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 26px;
      padding-top: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
    }

    footer p { margin: 0 0 5px; }

    .caveat { color: var(--quiet); }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .page {
        width: min(100% - 28px, 1180px);
        padding-top: 42px;
      }

      .masthead {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .key { max-width: 380px; }
      #legend { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 540px) {
      .page { width: 100%; padding-top: 30px; }
      .masthead, footer { margin-inline: 18px; }
      .chart-card { border-inline: 0; border-radius: 0; }
      .controls { gap: 14px 18px; padding-inline: 16px; }
      .reset { width: 100%; margin-left: 0; text-align: left; }
      .chart-meta { align-items: start; padding-inline: 18px; }
      .chart-meta span { max-width: 13rem; }
      .legend-wrap { padding-inline: 18px; }
      .legend-head { display: block; }
      .legend-head p { margin-top: 3px; }
      #chart { min-height: 450px; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <header class="masthead">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">IT power · median estimates</p>
        <h1>Data-center capacity additions by country, <span class="nowrap">2022–2026</span></h1>
        <p class="dek">Compare annual additions or each country’s cumulative build-out. The default log scale keeps smaller markets legible beside the United States and China.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="key" aria-label="Chart definitions">
        <div>
          <dt>Measure</dt>
          <dd>Critical IT capacity</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>2026</dt>
          <dd>Full-year estimate</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </header>

    <section class="chart-card" aria-label="Interactive capacity additions chart">
      <form class="controls" id="controls">
        <fieldset>
          <legend>Measure</legend>
          <div class="segmented">
            <label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="annual" checked=""><span>Annual</span></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="cumulative"><span>Since 2022</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Scale</legend>
          <div class="segmented">
            <label><input type="radio" name="scale" value="log" checked=""><span>Log</span></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="scale" value="linear"><span>Linear</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <label>
          <span class="select-label">Countries</span>
          <select id="country-count" aria-label="Number of countries shown">
            <option value="8">Top 8</option>
            <option value="12">Top 12</option>
            <option value="all">All 22</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <button class="reset" id="reset" type="button" hidden="">Return to ranking</button>
      </form>

      <div class="chart-meta" aria-live="polite">
        <strong id="chart-status">Annual additions · 8 countries ranked by 2022–26 total</strong>
        <span id="chart-summary">Log scale · 2026 shown: 37,165 MW · Largest: United States</span>
