codex
Reworked [docs/index.html](/home/ubuntu/projects/dc-mw-additions/docs/index.html:281) into a responsive line chart:

- Solid 2022–25 lines; dashed final segments and open markers for 2026 estimates.
- Annual/cumulative and log/linear toggles retained, with log as default.
- Top 8/12/all filtering and legend isolate/compare preserved.
- Linked reasoning tooltips available on every point.
- Collision-adjusted labels for the top four lines on desktop.
- Mobile, dark mode, `noindex`, footer, and caveats retained.

Verified via `python3 -m http.server` and `curl` with HTTP 200 responses. Headless Chromium tests exercised controls, legend comparison, tooltips, mobile and dark modes, with no page console errors. Only `docs/index.html` was edited.
